A patch on upstream Mermaid at the pin, for the reference ferrigura is checked against
(docs/decisions/0014-upstream-reference-at-a-pin.md). Applied in the order of the file names by tools/reference/setup.sh.

fix(security): reserve renderer-owned SVG IDs and remap colliding fragment links

User-controlled node, subgraph, class, state, and Gantt task IDs can collide with
renderer-owned SVG IDs (such as arrowhead markers, pattern fills, or Gantt exclude-range
bars), hijacking url(#...) references or fragment links. This patch reserves
renderer-owned IDs, disambiguates colliding user IDs across unified and Gantt renderers,
and remaps same-document fragment hrefs without shadowing literal DOM IDs. Drop or
re-check when bumping the Mermaid pin if upstream namespaces or reserves renderer IDs.

